-- [S1] Applies a depth bidirectional inconsistency prior in the background MLP to restore occlusion-free backgrounds via depth distance supervision.
-#### pitfall
-- [S1] When the occluding object is a light-loss transparent glass body, reflection artifact noise pollution prevents generalization.
