-- [S3] Predict an additional output from the cache $c_{\text{irradiance}}(\mathbf{x}, \omega_o)$ and supervise it to match irradiance from the physically-based model (computed by setting BRDF to perfectly Lambertian with $a(\mathbf{x}) = 1$).
